---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="ReliefAid in Gaza | Community Transformation Trust" description="In 2023 CT Trust donated $10,000 NZD to ReliefAid to support emergency relief in Gaza, helping deliver safe drinking water, hot meals, and food kits to displaced families.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/projects/reliefaid-gaza.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>ReliefAid in Gaza</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>2023</span><span>Gaza</span></div>
    <p class="detail-lead">In 2023, CT Trust donated $10,000 NZD to ReliefAid to support their emergency relief work in Gaza, helping deliver safe drinking water, hot meals, and food kits to displaced families.</p>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Emergency relief where it is needed most</h3>
      <p>Gaza remains one of the world&rsquo;s most difficult humanitarian situations, where even the most basic needs are hard to meet.</p>
      <p>This funding helped deliver the essentials of survival to displaced families, reaching people at the moment they needed it most through an experienced partner working on the ground.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/projects/reliefaid-gaza.png" alt="Emergency relief supplies being distributed to displaced families" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>What the funding provided</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Safe drinking water for displaced families.</li>
        <li>Hot meals during acute emergency need.</li>
        <li>Food kits to sustain households through crisis.</li>
        <li>Support delivered through an experienced on-the-ground partner.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>The lasting difference</h3>
      <p>In an emergency, timely funding saves lives. Partnering with ReliefAid allowed CT Trust to turn support into immediate, practical relief for families facing extraordinary hardship.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
